<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-2')">2</a>. Esperanto; translates to &quot;Best Judgement.&quot;</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-3"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-3')">3</a>. Esperanto; translates to &quot;New Judgement.&quot; Pronounced /yo͞o·jo no·va/.</div>
